## 1. Chronological Split & Leakage Prevention

To ensure genuine, unvarnished real-world evaluation, observations were partitioned chronologically with zero target leakage:

```
+------------------------------------+---------------------+-----------------------------+
|          TRAINING PERIOD           |  VALIDATION PERIOD  |   HELD-OUT TEST BENCHMARK   |
|       2001-01-01 to 2023-12-31     |     2024-01-01 to   |       2025-01-01 to         |
|              (~23 Years)           |      2024-12-31     |        2026-04-20           |
|                                    |      (1 Year)       |        (~1.3 Years)         |
+------------------------------------+---------------------+-----------------------------+
```

### Zero Lookahead Bias Guarantees:
1. **Past-Only Featurization:** 7-day and 30-day moving averages, 30-day price standard deviation, and 7-day momentum are calculated strictly over preceding observations where $t_{{\\text{{past}}}} < t_{{\\text{{current}}}}$.
2. **Untouched Test Benchmark:** The 2025–2026 test split was completely held out and never seen during categorical encoding, early stopping, or parameter fitting.
3. **Training-Only Baselines:** Seasonal lookup tables were derived solely from the training partition (years $\\le 2023$).

---

