## 4. Empirical Prediction Intervals (Confidence Bands)

Prediction intervals are calibrated using the validation set standard error:

$$\\text{{Prediction Interval}} = \\left[ \\max(50, \\hat{{P}} - 1.96 \\cdot \\text{{RMSE}}_{{\\text{{val}}}}), \\quad \\hat{{P}} + 1.96 \\cdot \\text{{RMSE}}_{{\\text{{val}}}} \\right]$$

- **7-Day Horizon:** Margin of error $\\approx \\pm ₹{1.96 * h7['rmse']:.2f}/\\text{{Q}}$
- **15-Day Horizon:** Margin of error $\\approx \\pm ₹{1.96 * h15['rmse']:.2f}/\\text{{Q}}$
- **30-Day Horizon:** Margin of error $\\approx \\pm ₹{1.96 * h30['rmse']:.2f}/\\text{{Q}}$
